  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wool for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The therapeutic benefits of working with wool are very well known and documented. At the Zywiec Development Foundation we have launched a programme to assist with supporting and providing relief to refugees from the Ukrainian War. This is a &quot;Wool for Ukraine&quot; programme which uses the therapeutic benefits of working with wool to offset the effects of the distress and growing spread of Post Traumatic Stress Disorders caused by this conflict and focuses on support for both children and adults.</narrative>
  </description>
